# task_produce_consume — (repurposed from channel_bounded_blocking: semanticscript has no
# channel primitive). A producer task computes a value; main joins and consumes
# it. Joining is the real synchronization/handoff point (README §13/§15.5).
#
# Correctness observation: producer task computes 21 * 2 = 42; main consumes it.
# Expected output: 42

TaskProduceConsume is project
TaskProduceConsume module examplesTaskProduceConsume
TaskProduceConsume target console
TaskProduceConsume entry main

examplesTaskProduceConsume is module
examplesTaskProduceConsume path examples.taskProduceConsume
examplesTaskProduceConsume exports main
examplesTaskProduceConsume purpose "Produce a value in a task, consume it after join"
examplesTaskProduceConsume invariant "The consumed value is the producer's real output"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

doubleIt is operation
doubleIt in n Int64
doubleIt out Int64
doubleIt memory heap no
doubleIt async no
doubleIt purpose "Return n doubled"
doubleIt invariant "Result is exactly 2*n"
doubleIt let two immutable Int64 2
doubleIt do mulCall
doubleIt return doubled

mulCall is call
mulCall in doubleIt
mulCall invokes math.multiplyInt64
mulCall arg left Int64 n
mulCall arg right Int64 two
mulCall out doubled Int64

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async yes
main purpose "Join a producer task and print the consumed value"
main invariant "Writes exactly one integer line: 42"
main let seed immutable Int64 21
main let harnessName immutable String "task_produce_consume"
main let harnessExpected immutable Int64 42
main let noopDecoy immutable Int64 0
main let noopName immutable String "task_produce_consume: real result (not the no-op 0)"
main start producer
main join producer
main do writeResult
main do noopCheck
main do harnessReport
main return harnessSummaryCode

producer is task
producer in main
producer invokes doubleIt
producer arg n Int64 seed
producer out produced Int64

writeResult is call
writeResult in main
writeResult invokes test.assertEqualInt64
writeResult arg name String harnessName
writeResult arg expected Int64 harnessExpected
writeResult arg actual Int64 produced


noopCheck is call
noopCheck in main
noopCheck invokes test.assertNotEqualInt64
noopCheck arg name String noopName
noopCheck arg expected Int64 noopDecoy
noopCheck arg actual Int64 produced

harnessReport is call
harnessReport in main
harnessReport invokes test.summary
harnessReport out harnessSummaryCode ExitCode